{"hookSpecificOutput": {"hookEventName": "PreToolUse", "permissionDecision": "deny", "permissionDecisionReason": "dangerous-ops-guard [git-history-rewrite]: git filter-repo / filter-branch rewrites history across the entire repository. Confirm explicitly and back up the refs first (git for-each-ref > backup.txt). [command-sha256:673ff420b19f9b6002f27a7aa12af71b0038f7f1ce983c2964db2a61aaf7c5ea] If you truly intend this, run it in a shell outside the harness, or update harness/hooks/lib/dangerous_ops_guard.py to exempt the pattern."}}
